# DC-86
C('D-86', S, 'Design: A window stays open on Esc and on a click outside it',
  ['Sign in as an Admin (a user with every setting, See Financial Data included).', 'Use a desktop browser window 1440 pixels wide at 100% zoom.', 'Have Internal Work Orders turned on in Settings > Work Orders.', 'Have a regular customer (not flagged), with one asset.', 'Have a new billable work order for the regular customer, not invoiced, with no deposit, made for this test.', 'Open the attached pictures iwo-flow2-04-02-confirm.png, iwo-happy-22-22-confirm-category-and-original-work-order.png at 100% zoom beside the screen.'],
  ['Open the work order.', 'Click the three-dots menu in the header.', 'Click Convert to No Charge.', 'Press Esc.', 'Click on the page outside the window.'],
  [['The work order opens.'], ['The menu opens.'], ['The window "Convert work order [number] to No Charge?" opens.'], ['The window stays open and nothing changes.'], ["The window still stays open; only Cancel or the window's own buttons close it."]],
  [('S1-R2', 'Closing the modal with X acts as "Do this later" (S1-R5); Esc and a click outside do nothing, as in every dialog of the app.'), ('S4-R2', 'Dismissing the dialog in any other way does nothing.')],
  note="Words in square brackets in a message stand for the value they name, such as the work order's number or the customer's name exactly as it is saved; every other word of the message must match exactly.",
  stories=[1, 2])
